  "statusText": "Closed\nThis project no longer accepts pledges or changes.\nFollow to get updates",
  "rewardData": "8 1/2 x 11 print__$25.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | 5 + 5 prints__$200.00(https://cdn.images.indiegogo.com/productimage/noimage.jpg) | ",
